01:00:28.480 --> 01:00:28.660
VIP.

01:00:29.400 --> 01:00:29.840
Ejecutivos,

01:00:30.020 --> 01:00:30.860
aprobadores financieros,

01:00:31.180 --> 01:00:31.920
personas cuyo bloqueo

